        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: John Stark Regional High School, Weare School District, SAU 24\n- Places: Weare, Henniker, Merrimack County, New Hampshire, United States\n- Concepts: regional public high school, multi-town school district\n\nFacts:\n- Henniker is a town in Merrimack County, New Hampshire, United States.\n- John Stark Regional High School is a coeducational regional public high school in Weare, New Hampshire.\n- John Stark Regional High School serves the communities of Weare and Henniker, New Hampshire.\n- Weare School District sends high school students to John Stark Regional High School.\n- John Stark Regional High School is part of its own multi-town school district within SAU 24.",
